    "description": "Participated on the development of a web application that uses voice queries and a natural language user interface to deliver individualized and context-sensitive information from 2D and 3D models.\n•\tDeveloped a dynamic website using C# and following the Model-View-Controller (MVC) architectural pattern used by the ASP.NET Core framework.\n•       Built the Virtual Assistant feature using Google’s Dialogflow API for natural language processing and Firebase for the management of model information.\n•\tUsed AJAX to asynchronously transmit data to and from the server.\n•\tHandled users’ data using the Microsoft SQL Server.\n•\tUsed JavaScript to access the Autodesk Forge’s Data Management API to handle the BIM model data.\n•\tAutomated API tests with Postman.\n",
